    <string name="settings_covers">Covers</string>
    <string name="online_covers">Online covers</string>
    <string name="online_covers_summary">Off by default. Search covers from the song menu, or fetch all missing covers at once</string>
    <string name="online_covers_privacy_title">Turn on online covers?</string>
    <string name="online_covers_privacy">When searching, the song’s title, artist and album are sent to the cover sources you choose (by default NetEase Cloud Music, QQ Music, Apple iTunes and MusicBrainz), and images are downloaded from them. Nothing else is sent, and nothing is sent until you search (or turn on automatic fetching).</string>
    <string name="cover_save_mode">Save online covers to</string>
    <string name="cover_save_hidden">Hidden folder (recommended)</string>
    <string name="cover_save_hidden_summary">.jeekmusic/covers/ in the music folder, one image per album. Music files are not changed</string>
    <string name="cover_save_embed">Inside the music file</string>
    <string name="cover_save_embed_summary">Other players can see it too. The file’s modified time is kept. Needs “All files access”. Covers already downloaded are written in too, and the downloaded images deleted</string>
    <string name="cover_save_sidecar">Next to the song, with the same name</string>
    <string name="cover_save_sidecar_summary">Song name.jpg; these images also show up in the gallery</string>
    <string name="cover_fetch_missing">Fetch all missing covers</string>
    <string name="cover_fetch_confirm_title">Fetch all missing covers?</string>
    <string name="cover_fetch_confirm">Every song in the library will be checked. Albums without a cover are looked up online (covers already in the same album are reused) and saved to the location set under “Save online covers to”. With many songs this takes a while; it runs in the background and you can tap to stop at any time.</string>
    <string name="lyrics_fetch_confirm_title">Fetch all missing lyrics?</string>
    <string name="lyrics_fetch_confirm">Every song in the library will be checked. Songs without lyrics are looked up online one by one and saved to the location set under “Save online lyrics to”. With many songs this takes a while; it runs in the background and you can tap to stop at any time.</string>
    <string name="fetch_confirm_embed">They are currently saved inside the music files, so these music files will be modified (their modified time is kept).</string>
    <string name="fetch_confirm_start">Start</string>
    <string name="cover_fetch_summary">Only accepts results whose title and artist both match. Needs a network connection</string>
    <string name="cover_fetch_checking">Checking which songs have no cover… tap to stop</string>
